 "label_rule": "VCR1-WCR3 architecture only (paper's best library; screened in all 3 lines). Per line and replicate: LFC(end vs pDNA) centred on AAVS1xAAVS1, f_g = median LFC of gene x AAVS1, GI = LFC - f_a - f_b, median over the 18 guide pairs (both orientations); pooled GI from the replicate-mean LFC; score = z of pooled GI over all 423 gene pairs in the line. Positive: z <= -3 and GI < 0 in all 3 replicates. Negative: |z| < 1. Else null. Same z<=-3 / |z|<1 convention as spidr2025 and the zdLFC paralog sources; the authors give no binary call (GEMINI scores only; FDR not published per pair), so we re-score.",
